      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "The fixed harness calls png_read_update_info before png_start_read_image and then attempts png_read_row. There is no input controlled branch between those two initialization calls; the intervening guards check IHDR retrieval and image area.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-e9cdca141412a92154b2",
          "start_line": 139,
          "end_line": 175,
          "role": "primary",
          "dependency_reason": ""
        }
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "On both versions, png_app_error chooses png_warning when PNG_FLAG_APP_ERRORS_WARN is set and png_error otherwise. The supplied lines do not establish the flag's initial value or the resulting control flow through png_error.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "unit_id": "u-d1a66dd20f4a316243f6",
          "start_line": 404,
          "end_line": 415,
          "role": "primary",
